DELIBERATE UPSTREAM EXCLUSION (packaging decision 2026-10-02):
the four LiberationSans-{Regular,Bold,Italic,BoldItalic}.ttf and both
LICENSE_LIBERATION copies were REMOVED from this payload. Liberation 1.x
is GPLv2 with font exceptions and carries an unresolved corresponding-
source question; pdf.js fetches LiberationSans only as the last-resort
fallback for non-embedded Helvetica (local Helvetica/Arial resolve first
on macOS), so exclusion removes the Liberation-specific GPLv2 obligations at no
expected rendering cost; other copyleft components (e.g. PreviewEngine)
keep their own notices. See pdfjs-integration-GATES.md Addendum B.

